          "topic": "Health Care",
          "value": "Will continue to fight for legislation to repeal and replace Obamacare with policies that restore health care freedom in America.",
          "snippet": "I will continue to fight for legislation to repeal and replace Obamacare with policies that restore health care freedom in America. I will not stop working to rescue the American people from this disastrous law."
