        {
          "topic": "Abortion",
          "value": "Is a steadfast defender of the sanctity of human life and protecting the unborn. Has consistently voted to cut off taxpayer funding for Planned Parenthood.",
          "snippet": "I am a steadfast defender of the sanctity of human life and protecting the unborn. In Congress, I have earned a 100% rating from the National Right to Life and been actively engaged in the Congressional Pro-Life Caucus. I have also consistently voted to cut off taxpayer funding for Planned Parenthood – the largest abortion provider in the nation."
        },
        {
          "topic": "Social Security and Medicare",
